    },
    {
      "name": "compliance-body-0",
      "text": "2017年巡视整改取得一定成效，也暴露人力条线基础管理",
      "role": "body",
      "left": 91,
      "top": 568.96,
      "width": 505.9047619047619,
      "height": 26
    },
    {
      "name": "compliance-body-1",
      "text": "薄弱：认识待提升、作风待转变、能力待增强、协同待深化。",
      "role": "body",
      "left": 91,
      "top": 594.96,
      "width": 505.9047619047619,
      "height": 26
    },
    {
      "name": "insights-0",
      "text": "四点感悟",
      "role": "heading",
      "left": 628.9047619047619,
      "top": 166,
      "width": 596.0952380952382,
