      "top": 215,
      "width": 29,
      "height": 19.32
    },
    {
      "name": "language-label-0",
      "text": "统一语言，促进业务与人力协同",
      "role": "label",
      "left": 664.9047619047619,
      "top": 214,
      "width": 560.0952380952382,
      "height": 28.979999999999997
    },
    {
      "name": "language-body-0",
      "text": "沿BLM管理模型统一语言、目标、策略，贯通业务战略、",
      "role": "body",
      "left": 664.9047619047619,
      "top": 249.98,
      "width": 560.0952380952382,
      "height": 26
    },
    {
      "name": "language-body-1",
      "text": "人力战略规划与落地方案，达成“三个市场化”转型目标。",
      "role": "body",
      "left": 664.9047619047619,
      "top": 275.98,
      "width": 560.0952380952382,
      "height": 26
    },
    {
      "name": "criterion-number-0",
      "text": "02",
      "role": "meta",
      "left": 628.9047619047619,
      "top": 329.98,
      "width": 29,
      "height": 19.32
    },
    {
      "name": "criterion-label-0",
      "text": "解决实际问题是唯一检验标准",
      "role": "label",
      "left": 664.9047619047619,
      "top": 328.98,
      "width": 560.0952380952382,
      "height": 28.979999999999997
    },
    {
      "name": "criterion-body-0",
      "text": "以能否解决实际问题检验变革成效，力求落地有实效。",
      "role": "body",
      "left": 664.9047619047619,
      "top": 364.96000000000004,
      "width": 560.0952380952382,
      "height": 26
    },
    {
